  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measures &#xbf; Cooperation facility Nicaragua 2021-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed action will provide the EU delegation with the necessary tools and instruments to ensure high standard and quality results in the implementation of its cooperation and communication strategies in Nicaragua. Building on lessons learned from previous cooperation facility interventions, which have been instrumental in providing technical support and capacity across the project management cycle, creating spaces for policy dialogue with different stakeholders and promoting EU messages and visibility in the country, the action clearly falls under the MIP priority &#xbf;Support Measures&#xbf;.</narrative>
  </description>
